sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 用户
    participant M as Main Agent
    participant C as Domain Core
    participant R as Router Agent
    participant W as Worker Agent
    participant O as Outbox / Channels

    U->>M: 自然语言、附件、执行目标
    M->>C: delegate_work(WorkBrief)
    C-->>M: 持久回执 routing / accepted
    C->>R: 受权 WorkBrief + 原始证据
    R->>C: establish_work_plan(1–4 items)
    C->>C: Ticket + Mandate + Assignment + Subscription
    C->>W: Assignment + 目标 / 约束 / 验收 / 有界上下文
    W->>W: 工具执行 + 验证证据

    alt 需要人决定
        W->>C: ask_human(Attention)
        C-->>M: 工作卡与结构化问题
        U->>M: 明确回答
        M->>C: answerMainAttention
        C->>W: 稳定 WorkInput / 同一工作恢复
    else 形成结果
        W->>C: report_ready(evidence, artifacts)
        C->>M: WorkUpdate / WorkOutcome
        M->>C: 当前结果对应的 completed Main reply
        C->>O: purpose-bound result delivery
        O-->>U: Main / GitHub / Feishu / IM
    end
